(text "V0.7.1 读图说明 | Microphone 单麦与供电" (at 426 18 0) (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7fe567df-f4e3-5f95-9e59-21430014b44b"))
(text "用途：U5 单颗 PDM 麦克风及受控供电。" (at 426 26 0) (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "653b0360-52e3-58db-8996-cb3d27c4e2fa"))
(text "按用户要求移除 U6 右麦及其专属数据支路。" (at 426 30.5 0) (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ebde0868-4752-5082-99cc-6ce9a05a9e2f"))
(text "U5 CLK 接 PDM_CLK_MIC，时钟由下一页 U9 提供。" (at 426 35.0 0) (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "88959e30-7795-5e7f-83f9-901e1425990f"))
(text "U5 数据经 U10 到 PDM_DATA_L（U1.4 / GPIO4）。" (at 426 39.5 0) (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "94d3eec9-3c38-5408-8d2e-7f59c9c8ebb1"))
(text "U5.5 LR 接 GND；单麦固件选择对应左通道采样。" (at 426 44.0 0) (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9bccd0c3-eb9b-54ae-baa0-4223704cce90"))
(text "Q1源极直接接+3V3，导通后才有MIC_3V3。" (at 426 48.5 0) (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9d0172c9-911d-5bb9-bc7a-53edb5dbdf6b"))
(text "台架跳线已移除；Q1、U9、U10继续保留。" (at 426 53.0 0) (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c5a09fe6-5995-56e9-aec0-61930afa9a38"))
(text "MIC_ENABLE_N 为低有效（来自 U7.7）。" (at 426 57.5 0) (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "29440597-3082-5333-a986-becb9319bd13"))
(text "MCU 复位或 I2C 卡死不保证能关麦；" (at 426 62.0 0) (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f5a90c61-52fd-5ac6-95d3-3129f28928d7"))
